msgid "chapterInstallationLore"
msgstr "Your dome has just settled. Keep it alive without waking the Trench."

msgid "chapterReefLore"
msgstr "The reef has creatures of its own, and they are listening. Hold your dome."

msgid "chapterRiftLore"
msgstr "Beneath the reef, a Leviathan guards every Rift. Whoever goes down never comes back up."

msgid "chapterChimneyLore"
msgstr "The forge-towers of the Ancients still smoke. Beyond the Titan lies the road to the Core."

msgid "chapterKernelLore"
msgstr "The Lord of the Core sleeps on the heart of the Trench. Take his place, and the Volcano will open its eye."

msgid "chapterAwakeningLore"
msgstr "With every fire rekindled, the Kraken rises. At the tenth, the Trench lights up: the Volcano is tamed."

